  "description": "ARK-RAPID Watch for ASP.NET Core. One call registers the audit client from configuration; the injected IAuditClient fills the correlation ID, client IP, user and tenant from the current request; buffered events are flushed on graceful shutdown; optional middleware records one audit event per HTTP request. Built on Ark.Watch.Client, so logging still never blocks or throws.",
